        <div class="wrap">
          <div>
            <div class="folio">§ 03 · Open the hood</div>
            <h1>Design <span class="accent">notes</span>.</h1>
          </div>
          <p class="lede">
            Two working models — the IR as a contract, and the capability planner as a lazy loader — plus
            the architecture decisions that pin them in place. Hover below. Toggle. Watch the machine.
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>
